oration:none;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px\">Je confirme mon inscription</a>\n<a href=\"{{calendly_url}}\" style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#1a56db;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #1a56db\">Réserver un appel</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#666\">WhatsApp &amp; Agent IA : <strong>+225 07 16 57 39 90</strong></p>\n<p>Bien cordialement,<br><strong>L'équipe TransferAI Nettelecom CI</strong><br>\nWhatsApp &amp; Agent IA : +225 07 16 57 39 90<br>\nEmail : contact@transferai.ci<br>\nRiviera 3, carrefour Sainte Famille, Abidjan, Côte d'Ivoire</p>\n</div>`.replace('{{prenom}}',prenom).replace('{{google_form_url}}','https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf8qtoXBTusqppHwdIoVfyXX9n12UbKBg34_bmAyxNzFPC_xA/viewform').replace('{{calendly_url}}','https://calendly.com/contact-transferai/appel-decouverte-formation-ia-pratique');\nreturn [{json:{...p,prenom,email2_body:body}}];\n"
